# 7. Creating Alert Rules

Navigate:

```
Alerting → Alert Rules
```

Click:

```
New Alert Rule
```

---

## 7.1 Pod Restart Alert

Query:

```promql
sum by(namespace,pod)(
increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{
namespace=~"osdp-cadmp-global-services-services-staging|osdp-cadmp-internal-services-development"
}[2m]))
```

Alert condition:

```
last() of A > 0
```

Evaluation settings:

```
Evaluation Interval: 10s
```

Alert name:

```
CADMP Pod Restart Alert
```

Save rule.

---

# 8. Configuring Email Alert Notifications

Grafana requires SMTP configuration.

SMTP relay used:

```
mailrelay.int.nokia.com
Port: 25
```

---

# 9. Configure SMTP in Grafana

Edit Grafana ConfigMap.

```
kubectl edit configmap prometheus-grafana -n monitoring
```

Locate section:

```
grafana.ini
```

Add SMTP configuration:

```
[smtp]
enabled = true
host = mailrelay.int.organization.com:25 or 587
from_address = grafana@organization.com
from_name = Grafana Alerts
skip_verify = true
```

Save and exit.

---

# 10. Restart Grafana

Grafana runs as StatefulSet.

Delete pod:

```
kubectl delete pod prometheus-grafana-0 -n monitoring
```

Kubernetes automatically recreates the pod.

Verify:

```
kubectl get pods -n monitoring
```

Wait until:

```
prometheus-grafana-0 Running
```

---

# 11. Configure Email Contact Point

In Grafana UI:

```
Alerting → Contact Points
```

Edit:

```
grafana_default_email
```

Add recipient email:

```
rajdip.roy@nokia.com
```

Save.

---

# 12. Configure Notification Policy

Navigate:

```
Alerting → Notification Policies
```

Ensure default policy routes alerts to:

```
grafana_default_email
```

---

# 13. Testing Alert

Restart a pod manually.

Example:

```
kubectl exec -it <pod-name> -n <namespace> -- kill 1
```

Check pod status:

```
kubectl get pods -n <namespace>
```

The restart counter increases.

---

# 14. Verify Alert Trigger

In Grafana:

```
Alerting → Alert Rules
```

Alert state transitions:

```
Normal → Pending → Firing
```

---

# 15. Verify Email Delivery

Email should arrive within:

```
30–60 seconds
```

Check inbox or spam folder.

---

