Check Grafana logs:

```
kubectl logs prometheus-grafana-0 -n monitoring
```

Check Prometheus pods:

```
kubectl get pods -n monitoring
```

Check metrics directly:

```
kubectl top pods -n <namespace>
```

Check restart count:

```
kubectl get pods -n <namespace>
```

