# 17. Recommended Production Alerts

Create additional alerts for:

### High CPU

```
sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total[2m])) by (pod) > 0.8
```

### High Memory

```
sum(container_memory_usage_bytes) by (pod) 
/ sum(container_spec_memory_limit_bytes) by (pod) > 0.9
```

### High Disk Usage

```
(node_filesystem_size_bytes - node_filesystem_free_bytes) / node_filesystem_size_bytes > 0.8
```

