# 18. Final Monitoring Architecture

```
Kubernetes Pods
      ↓
Node Exporter / kube-state-metrics
      ↓
Prometheus
      ↓
Grafana Dashboards
      ↓
Alert Rules
      ↓
SMTP Relay
      ↓
Email Notification
```

